# Web UI

- App Router. Authenticated apps hold Auth0 sessions server-side and call the API through `/api/backend`. No Management API, database URLs, or session secrets in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` or client bundles.
- Feature UI: `apps/admin-web/src/features`, `apps/resident-web/src/features`. Shared widgets: `packages/ui`.
- User-visible copy goes in `packages/app-platform/locales/{en,te}` with matching keys. Do not hardcode product strings.
- Reuse existing form validation and feedback helpers. Cover loading, empty, validation, success, and failure.
- Login web has no Auth0 application. Operator UI must not bypass API operator allowlisting.
- Do not add fake checkout, demo role switchers, or static operational metrics as live data.
- Resident PWA: do not cache authenticated tenant payloads in the service worker.
